{"id":"000VZF","title":"Mayonnaise (oil, vinegar, egg)","author":"gk122","solvedCount":3,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-10T23:28:17+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 19:55 Uhr","rules":"This puzzle was inspired by this series by Blobz and uses a variant of the oil and water ruleset.\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nDigits in cages don't repeat and sum to the clue, if given.\n\nEvery digit is either egg, oil or vinegar.\n\n• Egg: exactly one digit is egg (to be deduced).\n\n• Oil: every even digit that is not egg.\n\n• Vinegar: every odd digit that is not egg.\n\nOil and vinegar cages: in any cage not containing an egg, every row of the cage is either all oil or all vinegar. Oil rows are always above vinegar rows (oil and vinegar don't mix).\n\nMayonnaise cages: a cage containing an egg is emulsified. Egg, oil and vinegar can go anywhere within the cage.\n\nExample (the egg is 9): the left cage doesn't contain an egg, so oil (4, 2) is above vinegar (1, 3, 5, 7). The right cage contains an egg, so it is emulsified and oil and vinegar can be anywhere in it.\n\nPlay online: SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Row 9","tags":["Sudoku","Killer (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/ne2p7f73ue","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/ne2p7f73ue","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":9,"hasSolution":true,"features":[]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-10T23:28:17+00:00"}